      "source": "Placental evolution",
      "description": "A collection of life reconstructions of north american mammals from the Campanian stage of the Late Cretaceous: Mesodma primaeva (top left), Alphadon halleyi (top right), Gypsonictops lewisi (bottom left), indeterminate therian interpreted as an hypothetical early placental (bottom right).",
